 body={"output":"Sure! Start with a solid warm‑up (jog, dynamic stretches). Find a soft surface (gym mat or grass) and practice a strong, controlled jump, pulling your knees to your chest. Spot a wall or spotter for safety, then try a “backward roll” to get comfortable. Use a trampoline or gymnastics coach for extra support, and always land with bent knees to absorb impact. Let me know if you need gear suggestions!"}
